# The GBA emulator runs a test ROM with a BIOS of one instruction, gbabios.bin, which jumps to the ROM. The ROM is bands.gba in gui/data/rom, which gui/data/mkroms.py makes. It draws a fixed picture and then loops, so the script is an exact test. Mode 3 shows a colour gradient. The Del key stops the emulator.
class exact
window 500x400
run {mount -nc '#Z/hostfs' /mnt/term >[2]/dev/null || bind /lib/r9data /mnt/term}; games/gba -b /mnt/term/rom/gbabios.bin /mnt/term/rom/bands.gba
pause 3
quiet
snap rom
exit "\x7f"
